data: {"id": "c2782de0347942dc-thinking-parallel_evidence-1093", "run_id": "c2782de0347942dc", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已确认 Pod 身份与生命周期：`workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` (Namespace: `aiops-case-09`, Node: `node2`, UID: `2435240c-9902-...`) 当前状态为 **Running**，但 **NotReady**。\n\n### 证据汇总\n\n**1. 支持候选原因：Readiness Probe 失败导致 NotReady**\n*   **Kubernetes 事件 (kubectl_describe)**: 存在大量连续的 `Warning Unhealthy` 事件。\n    *   早期事件 (33m前): `Readiness probe failed: ... dial tcp 172.16.104.26:8080: connect: connection refused`。这表明确实存在端口不通的情况，可能是应用启动慢或进程未监听。\n    *   当前持续事件 (最近3m39s, x623): `Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with stat", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788460049184, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

